  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trauma Counselling &amp; Youth Peace Building Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall goal of the project:
Reduced suffering in silence and improved psychosocial wellbeing through tolerance and peace building initiatives

Outcomes:
Outcome 1: Improved provision of psychosocial services to survivors of violence and trauma 
Output 1: Improved access to trauma counselling facilities and referrals 
Output 2: Change in attitude towards seeking help (psychosocial support) in communities.

Outcome 2: Strengthened capacity of facilitators, peace champions and communities through, linking people with psychosocial problems to resources and services
Output 1: Improved knowledge, responses, case management, psychological counselling, psychotherapy or other psychological interventions

Outcome 3: Strengthening justice and peace committees on transformational behaviours, peace building and tolerance at community level
Output 1: Improved social behaviours rooted in tolerance driven by local community players</narrative>
  </description>
